  "packProvenanceNote": "NE attack reuses the exact own idle opening and three newly authored free CPU source-UV keys: ready, shaft-aligned thrust, recovery,880ms one-shot. Original60 poses/31 other clips/pivots/body calibration remain exact; page extends below3200px and rooted bounds expand for the weapon.2322 exact own-seed donor pixels (1985 body,337 far-arm underlap),375 existing elbow overlap pixels, no other-facing pixels/provider jobs. Native contact/readability pending.",
  "packReadme": "# Human Spearman preview\n\nDefault v1 pack0.11.0 retains all60 prior poses and adds three own-Northeast ready/thrust/recovery poses, using the exact existing idle opening. All8 source walk headings remain; NE attack plays once in880ms. Existing pivots/body scale and31 other clips are unchanged. The complete prior2048x3200 pixel/mask prefix remains, with the page extended to2048x3584 and rooted weapon bounds expanded.\n\nThere are63 registered poses:32 originals,28 previously authored walks and3 newly authored attack poses. Own-seed reconstruction is explicit:1985 body donor pixels plus337 hidden far-arm donor pixels,2322 total;375 existing source elbow pixels overlap on attached planes. All derived source keys and receipts remain in the Human roster source tree; every private trial/scene/script is retained separately. No paid/provider job, private input, borrowed facing or held replacement identity.\n\nSource gaps: Spearman13 (attack N/E/S/SW/W/NW; defeat N/NE/E/S/SW/W/NW), Infantry21, Archer21:55 military source cells. All63 original native/deployed cells and identified ordinary-game contact/readability remain unverified. The full builder replays public NE/E/N/S/SW/W/NW walk stages and this NE action stage deterministically.\n",
